  <eClassifiers xsi:type="ecore:EClass" name="GapSummary">
    <eAnnotations>
      <details key="appinfo" value="&#xA;              &#xA;  &lt;m:formal-name xmlns:m=&quot;http://csrc.nist.gov/ns/oscal/metaschema/1.0&quot;>Gap Summary&lt;/m:formal-name>&#xA;              &#xA;  &lt;m:description xmlns:m=&quot;http://csrc.nist.gov/ns/oscal/metaschema/1.0&quot;>&#xA;    A &#xA;    &lt;em xmlns=&quot;http://csrc.nist.gov/ns/oscal/1.0&quot;>by-id&lt;/em>&#xA;     collection of all controls that were not mapped at all in this &#xA;    &lt;code xmlns=&quot;http://csrc.nist.gov/ns/oscal/1.0&quot;> mapping-collection&lt;/code>&#xA;    . If a control is partially mapped, the parts of the control are not mappable, the gap and discrepancies should be documented in the &#xA;    &lt;code xmlns=&quot;http://csrc.nist.gov/ns/oscal/1.0&quot;> relationship-gal&lt;/code>&#xA;    . &#xA;  &lt;/m:description>&#xA;           &#xA;"/>
    </eAnnotations>
