  <eClassifiers xsi:type="ecore:EDataType" name="RelationshipType" instanceClassName="java.lang.String">
    <eAnnotations>
      <details key="appinfo" value="&#xA;                       &#xA;  &lt;m:formal-name xmlns:m=&quot;http://csrc.nist.gov/ns/oscal/metaschema/1.0&quot;>Mapping Entry Relationship&lt;/m:formal-name>&#xA;                       &#xA;  &lt;m:description xmlns:m=&quot;http://csrc.nist.gov/ns/oscal/metaschema/1.0&quot;>&#xA;    The relationship type for the mapping entry, which describes the relationship between the effective requirements of the specified source and target sets in the context of the &#xA;    &lt;code xmlns=&quot;http://csrc.nist.gov/ns/oscal/1.0&quot;>matching-rationale&lt;/code>&#xA;     method globaly defined in the &#xA;    &lt;code xmlns=&quot;http://csrc.nist.gov/ns/oscal/1.0&quot;>provenance&lt;/code>&#xA;     unless overwritten locally in the &#xA;    &lt;code xmlns=&quot;http://csrc.nist.gov/ns/oscal/1.0&quot;> map&lt;/code>&#xA;    . The &#xA;    &lt;code xmlns=&quot;http://csrc.nist.gov/ns/oscal/1.0&quot;>relationship&lt;/code>&#xA;     type and the &#xA;    &lt;code xmlns=&quot;http://csrc.nist.gov/ns/oscal/1.0&quot;>matching-rationale&lt;/code>&#xA;     must be used together. However, more than one &#xA;    &lt;code xmlns=&quot;http://csrc.nist.gov/ns/oscal/1.0&quot;>matching-rationale&lt;/code>&#xA;     method may apply to a &#xA;    &lt;code xmlns=&quot;http://csrc.nist.gov/ns/oscal/1.0&quot;>source&lt;/code>&#xA;     and &#xA;    &lt;code xmlns=&quot;http://csrc.nist.gov/ns/oscal/1.0&quot;>target&lt;/code>&#xA;     pair. &#xA;  &lt;/m:description>&#xA;                    &#xA;"/>
    </eAnnotations>
